title: "Ninaj Awin — The Eye of Fire"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Universidad Mayor de San Simón (UMSS)"
    affiliation: "Universidad Mayor de San Simón"
year: 2015
version: "Historical archive reconstruction, 2026"
repository-code: "https://github.com/eduardodisanti/ninaj-awin"
url: "https://eduardodisanti.github.io/ninaj-awin/"
abstract: >-
  Historical archive of Ninaj Awin, a multidisciplinary research and educational
  project developed at the Universidad Mayor de San Simón (UMSS), Cochabamba,
  Bolivia, in 2015. The project explored drones, autonomous agents, computer
  vision, fire and smoke detection, flight control, communications and
  firefighter-oriented support for early wildfire detection. The archive is
  maintained by Eduardo Di Santi.
keywords:
  - wildfire detection
  - autonomous drones
  - computer vision
  - UMSS
  - Bolivia
  - Parque Tunari
  - autonomous agents
  - historical archive
